(560, '12f1c6de-64b4-4885-a823-f2d7cd644143', '9781624901409', 'The time keeper', NULL, 'Mitch Albom', 'Hyperion Press', 'OL28768238M', '2011', 'Anglais', 'Romans', 'religious', 'paperback', 'all', 240, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'In The Time Keeper, the inventor of the world\'s first clock is punished for trying to measure God\'s greatest gift. He is banished to a cave for centuries and forced to listen to the voices of all who come after him seeking more days, more years.', 'In The Time Keeper, the inventor of the world\'s first clock is punished for trying to measure God\'s greatest gift. He is banished to a cave for centuries and forced to listen to the voices of all who come after him seeking more days, more years.', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Time, Fiction, Roman, Amerikanisches Englisch, nyt:combined-print-and-e-book-fiction=2012-09-23, New York Times bestseller, Magic, Freedom, Spirituality, Heaven, Fantasy fiction, Large type books, Fiction, fantasy, general, Tiempo, Novela, Fantasía, nyt:trade-fiction-paperback=2013-10-20, Father Time (Symbolic character), Redemption, Hour-glasses', 1, '2026-07-21 00:00:38', '2026-07-21 00:00:38'),
