(1231, 'b022d5a6-86f8-4dd2-b857-d828f1df701a', '9781406302240', 'Handa\'s Surprise', NULL, 'Eileen Browne', 'Ediciones Ekaré', 'OL45996067M', '1994', 'som', 'Romans', 'children', 'paperback', 'children', 28, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'Handa puts seven different delicious fruits in a basket to take to her firend Akeyo as a surprise. But Handa\'s walk takes her past a variety of animals, and the fruits do look very inviting...', 'Handa puts seven different delicious fruits in a basket to take to her firend Akeyo as a surprise. But Handa\'s walk takes her past a variety of animals, and the fruits do look very inviting...', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Amistad, Arabic language materials, Bilingual, Ficción juvenil, Fiction, Friendship, Fruit, Juvenile fiction, Luo (African people), Luo (Kenyan and Tanzanian people), Persian language materials, Surprise, Tamil language materials, Animals, Spanish: Grades 2-3, Kenya, Children\'s 4-8 - Picturebooks, Spanish: Grades 1-2, General, Fairy Tales & Folklore - General', 1, '2026-07-21 00:26:34', '2026-07-21 00:26:34'),
