(1499, '0b9f1e60-ef0c-43fa-a52d-1048c76ef507', '9780929631554', 'Selected from Carrie', NULL, 'Stephen King', 'Tandem Library', 'OL18372602M', '1992', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', 63, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'All her life, people have made fun of Carrie. She has no friends, and her mother is a cruel and insane woman. Selected from Carrie tells the story of Carrie\'s last days in high school. When her classmates pull their worst trick ever, Carrie strikes back with the full force of her deadly powers.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nSee also: \r\n\r\n - [Carrie][1]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81626W', 'All her life, people have made fun of Carrie. She has no friends, and her mother is a cruel and insane woman. Selected from Carrie tells the story of Carrie\'s last days in high school. When her classmates pull their worst trick ever, Carrie strikes back with the full force of her deadly powers.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nSee also: \r\n\r\n - [Carrie][1]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81626W', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Readers for new literates, Tales, Fiction, Readers, horror tales, basic reading', 1, '2026-07-21 15:04:59', '2026-07-21 15:04:59'),
