(1520, '32c848dc-53fc-404f-80d5-47ce01b34393', '9781442383746', 'Big Driver', NULL, 'Stephen King', 'Simon & Schuster Audio', 'OL34025603M', '2014', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', 148, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'Mystery writer, Tess, has been supplementing her writing income for years by doing speaking engagements with no problems. But following a last-minute invitation to a book club 60 miles away, she takes a shortcut home with dire consequences. ([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Full Dark, No Stars][2]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://www.stephenking.com/library/short_story/big_driver.html\r\n  [2]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15374110W/Full_Dark_No_Stars', 'Mystery writer, Tess, has been supplementing her writing income for years by doing speaking engagements with no problems. But following a last-minute invitation to a book club 60 miles away, she takes a shortcut home with dire consequences. ([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Full Dark, No Stars][2]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://www.stephenking.com/library/short_story/big_driver.html\r\n  [2]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15374110W/Full_Dark_No_Stars', 0.00, 0, 0, 'novellas, cozy mysteries, fiction, violence against women, revenge', 1, '2026-07-21 15:05:30', '2026-07-21 15:05:30'),
