(1525, '49ddfd6f-d8f7-4a8b-baaa-697ce4a6077c', '9781597770774', 'Quitters, Inc', NULL, 'Stephen King', 'Phoenix Audio', 'OL11088556M', '1996', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', NULL, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'When a friend offers to put him onto the ultimate stop-smoking method, Dick Morrison is grudgingly willing to give it a shot. Quitters, Inc. puts a high price on a stolen puff: a few volts of electricity to a loved one, perhaps a missing thumb. Just how important is another drag?\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [50 Greatest Mysteries of All Time](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5971851W)\r\n - [Night Shift][1]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81608W/Night_Shift', 'When a friend offers to put him onto the ultimate stop-smoking method, Dick Morrison is grudgingly willing to give it a shot. Quitters, Inc. puts a high price on a stolen puff: a few volts of electricity to a loved one, perhaps a missing thumb. Just how important is another drag?\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [50 Greatest Mysteries of All Time](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5971851W)\r\n - [Night Shift][1]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81608W/Night_Shift', 0.00, 0, 0, 'fiction, smoking cessation, cigarette habit, smoking, word of mouth, lung cancer, aversion training, drug withdrawl, mafia, mob enforcers, electroconvulsive therapy', 1, '2026-07-21 15:05:36', '2026-07-21 15:05:36'),
