(1527, 'add30628-9cbd-4716-aea0-faf80d07ddfd', '9780394297798', 'Gramma', NULL, 'Stephen King', 'Random House Audio', 'OL7456104M', '1987', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'history', 'paperback', 'all', NULL, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, '\"Gramma\" is a short horror story by American author Stephen King. It was first published in Weirdbook magazine in 1984 and collected in King\'s 1985 collection called Skeleton Crew. Certain characters/creatures/unearthly powers featured in the works of H. P. Lovecraft also appear in this story, making it a story set in the Cthulhu Mythos.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Skeleton Crew](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL149161W/Skeleton_Crew)', '\"Gramma\" is a short horror story by American author Stephen King. It was first published in Weirdbook magazine in 1984 and collected in King\'s 1985 collection called Skeleton Crew. Certain characters/creatures/unearthly powers featured in the works of H. P. Lovecraft also appear in this story, making it a story set in the Cthulhu Mythos.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Skeleton Crew](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL149161W/Skeleton_Crew)', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Short story, baseball, fractures, hospitals, repressed memories, infertility, miscarriage, stillbirth, obesity, incantation, witches, warlocks, aneurysm', 1, '2026-07-21 15:05:39', '2026-07-21 15:05:39'),
