(1566, '653166c0-0aab-464d-9464-65bb6a756d91', '9781449813901', 'In the Deathroom', NULL, 'Stephen King', 'Recorded Books', 'OL26992654M', '2010', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'magazine', 'paperback', 'all', NULL, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'A man named Fletcher is held captive in a South American stronghold.  His captors will use any tortuous means necessary to extract the information they want from him. His only hope lies with his last request--one last cigarette.\r\n([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Everything\'s Eventual][2]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://stephenking.com/library/short_story/in_the_deathroom.html\r\n  [2]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81584W/Everything\'s_Eventual', 'A man named Fletcher is held captive in a South American stronghold.  His captors will use any tortuous means necessary to extract the information they want from him. His only hope lies with his last request--one last cigarette.\r\n([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\nAlso contained in:\r\n\r\n - [Everything\'s Eventual][2]\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://stephenking.com/library/short_story/in_the_deathroom.html\r\n  [2]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81584W/Everything\'s_Eventual', 0.00, 0, 0, 'short stories, fiction, Suspense fiction, American horror tales, journalists, hostages, The New York Times, interrogation, communism, insurgency, seizures', 1, '2026-07-21 15:06:33', '2026-07-21 15:06:33'),
