(1660, 'f56a07aa-196d-45aa-b596-31e621aed634', '9780123820044', 'Dyneins', NULL, 'Stephen M. King', 'Elsevier Science & Technology Books', 'OL25095235M', '2011', 'Anglais', 'Stephen King', 'science', 'paperback', 'all', 618, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'Research on dyneins has a direct impact on human diseases, such as viruses and cancer. With an accompanying website showing over one hundred streaming videos of cell dynamic behavior for best comprehension of material, Dynein: Structure, Biology and Disease is the only reference covering the structure, biology and application of dynein research to human disease. From bench to bedside, Dynein: Structure, Biology and Disease offers research on fundamental cellular processes to researchers and clinicians across developmental biology, cell biology, molecular biology, biophysics, biomedicine, genetics and medicine. . Broad-based up-to-date resource for the dynein class of molecular motors . Chapters written by world experts in their topics . Numerous well-illustrated figures and tables included to complement the text, imparting comprehensive information on dynein composition, interactions, and other fundamental features.', 'Research on dyneins has a direct impact on human diseases, such as viruses and cancer. With an accompanying website showing over one hundred streaming videos of cell dynamic behavior for best comprehension of material, Dynein: Structure, Biology and Disease is the only reference covering the structure, biology and application of dynein research to human disease. From bench to bedside, Dynein: Structure, Biology and Disease offers research on fundamental cellular processes to researchers and clin', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Dynein, Biology, Proteins', 1, '2026-07-21 15:09:33', '2026-07-21 15:09:33'),
