(2056, 'f3974dee-dd10-41b0-bb61-aac94ee73cc4', '9780297772958', 'Agatha Christie', 'First Lady of Crime', 'H. R. F. Keating, Agatha Christie, Sophie Hannah', 'Orion Publishing Group, Limited', 'OL34137886M', '1977', 'Anglais', 'Agatha Christie', 'history', 'paperback', 'all', 248, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'This is a collection of essays which was originally published in 1977, a year after Christie’s death. Diverse and gives very clear all round picture of Agatha Christie from differing perspectives. Contributors include Christianna Brand, H.R. F. Keating, Emma Lathen, Julian Symons and nine others.', 'This is a collection of essays which was originally published in 1977, a year after Christie’s death. Diverse and gives very clear all round picture of Agatha Christie from differing perspectives. Contributors include Christianna Brand, H.R. F. Keating, Emma Lathen, Julian Symons and nine others.', 0.00, 0, 0, 'English Authors, Biography, English Detective and mystery stories, History and criticism, Authors, english, Christie, agatha, 1891-1976, Handbooks, manuals', 1, '2026-07-21 15:21:00', '2026-07-21 15:21:00'),
