(2146, '857b7311-bc32-45f1-bb79-f2bcff64c4ca', '9780425152584', 'Senior Sleuths', NULL, 'Cynthia Manson, Agatha Christie', 'Berkley Prime Crime', 'OL7503829M', '1996', 'Anglais', 'Agatha Christie', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', 1, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0, 0, 'Older people, Fiction, American Detective and mystery stories, English Detective and mystery stories, Personnes âgées, Romans, nouvelles, Fiction, mystery & detective, general, Short stories', 1, '2026-07-21 15:23:48', '2026-07-21 15:23:48'),
(2147, 'ba9fe70b-6307-42ad-9c86-1d16ac0b2e08', '9780893402617', 'The case of the restless redhead', NULL, 'Erle Stanley Gardner', 'House of Stratus', 'OL43469834M', '1954', 'vie', 'Agatha Christie', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', 243, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, '\'There isn\'t any normal routine when you\'re dealing with redheads,\' said Perry Mason, and, as always, he was right. When Evelyn Bagby insists she\'s been framed for murder, Mason believes her -- even though she possesses the weapon and the victim\'s diamond necklace. And because he believes in the redhead, Perry Mason and sidekicks Della Street and Paul Drake wind up in one of the most complicated trials of their careers -- a trial with a shattering courtroom climax...', '\'There isn\'t any normal routine when you\'re dealing with redheads,\' said Perry Mason, and, as always, he was right. When Evelyn Bagby insists she\'s been framed for murder, Mason believes her -- even though she possesses the weapon and the victim\'s diamond necklace. And because he believes in the redhead, Perry Mason and sidekicks Della Street and Paul Drake wind up in one of the most complicated trials of their careers -- a trial with a shattering courtroom climax...', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Perry Mason (Fictitious character), Trials (Murder), Fiction, Mason, Perry (Fictitious character), Large type books, American fiction, Translations into Vietnamese, Detective and mystery stories, Private investigators', 1, '2026-07-21 15:23:49', '2026-07-21 15:23:49'),
