(2797, '497462c9-72b9-4da5-a01c-22856eb1c207', '9781884364518', 'Pokémon Gold and Silver', 'Japanese Translation Guide', 'J. Douglas Arnold, Mark Elies, James Yamada, Yo Takewaki', 'Sandwich Islands Publishing', 'OL12153344M', '2000', 'Anglais', 'Mark Douglas', 'other', 'paperback', 'all', 144, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'This is a complete walkthrough for the Japanese versions of the games, Pokemon Gold, and Pokemon Silver. It has full color screenshots, maps and translations of much of the games text. The guide was made for players who imported the game, and also as a introduction to the Japanese versions of Pokemon. There is a index to the monsters and a translation of the games menu. At the back of the book there is a two page section of pull out flash cards with common Japanese words, and their English meaning written below. These pages have 8 cards per page, with a different word on the from and on the back.', 'This is a complete walkthrough for the Japanese versions of the games, Pokemon Gold, and Pokemon Silver. It has full color screenshots, maps and translations of much of the games text. The guide was made for players who imported the game, and also as a introduction to the Japanese versions of Pokemon. There is a index to the monsters and a translation of the games menu. At the back of the book there is a two page section of pull out flash cards with common Japanese words, and their English meani', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Video games, Videogames, Games, Strategy, Puzzles, Passtimes, Hobbies, Game Boy, Game Boy Color', 1, '2026-07-21 15:43:31', '2026-07-21 15:43:31'),
