(2823, 'd91f85cd-2deb-44fe-a602-d18adaa9d2d4', '9780970646811', 'Official Pokemon Stadium 2', 'Perfect Guide', 'J. Douglas Arnold, James Yamada, Mark Elies', 'Versus Books, Empire 21 Publishing, Inc.', 'OL11775743M', '2001', 'Anglais', 'Mark Douglas', 'technology', 'paperback', 'all', 128, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'This is a strategy guide to the Nintendo 64 {N64} video game \"Pokemon Stadium 2\". It has color screenshots, and official illustrations of the characters as well as tips on playing as each characters, and battling the other characters. Inside the back cover there is a folded, detachable poster. The original price of the book was $9.99 in the U.S., $14.99 Canada, and £19.99 U.K.', 'This is a strategy guide to the Nintendo 64 {N64} video game \"Pokemon Stadium 2\". It has color screenshots, and official illustrations of the characters as well as tips on playing as each characters, and battling the other characters. Inside the back cover there is a folded, detachable poster. The original price of the book was $9.99 in the U.S., $14.99 Canada, and £19.99 U.K.', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Video & Electronic - General, Computer Books, General, Games / Video & Electronic, Pokemon Stadium, Games, Video & Electronic - Nintendo, Games / Gamebooks, Nintendo 64, N64, Video games, Videogames, Strategy, Passtimes, Hobbies, Electronic Entertainment, Role Playing Game, RPG, Battle Game, Nintendo', 1, '2026-07-21 15:44:13', '2026-07-21 15:44:13'),
