(2978, 'b5c9b73d-d7bc-4e50-acbc-186d1e439477', '9781884364457', 'Nintendo 64 Survival Guide', NULL, 'J. Douglas Arnold, Willy Campos, Mark Elies, Lee Saito, Nick Bennett', 'Sandwich Islands Pubblishing', 'OL8701092M', '1997', 'Anglais', 'Mark Douglas', 'history', 'paperback', 'all', 239, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'This is a strategy and walkthrough guide for eleven Nintendo 64 (N64) games. It has many gray-scale screenshots for each game, and diagram type maps for the games \'Super Mario 64\', and Turok: Dinosaur Hunter. It has tips, cheats strategies and fighter moves for the games \'Killer Instinct\', and \'Mortal Kombat Trilogy\'. Each section tells the games \'Developer\', Publisher\', \'Age rating\', \'Number of Players\', Game Type\', the way the \'Gave Save\' is loaded, what \'Peripherals\' can be used to play it, its \'Pros\' and \'Cons\'. Only two of the authors are credited on the books front cover, while on it\'s title page there are four listed, while the co-author Nick Bennett, is only listed on the opening page of the \'Pilotwings 64\' section. Parts of the \'Super Mario 64\' section were previously published in \'Super Mario 64, Survival Guide\' ISBN, 1884364195, condensed from 152 page book to 56 page section in this book, with fewer screenshots, most of which are reused from the previous book.', 'This is a strategy and walkthrough guide for eleven Nintendo 64 (N64) games. It has many gray-scale screenshots for each game, and diagram type maps for the games \'Super Mario 64\', and Turok: Dinosaur Hunter. It has tips, cheats strategies and fighter moves for the games \'Killer Instinct\', and \'Mortal Kombat Trilogy\'. Each section tells the games \'Developer\', Publisher\', \'Age rating\', \'Number of Players\', Game Type\', the way the \'Gave Save\' is loaded, what \'Peripherals\' can be used to play it, i', 0.00, 0, 0, 'N64, Passtimes, Video games, Strategy, Puzzles, Games, Hobbies, Videogames, Nintendo 64, Cruis\'n USA, Killer Instinct Gold, Mario