(3127, 'de86b2f4-60f2-4206-8b66-a6041b7fa084', '9781884364341', 'Nintendo 64', 'Survival Guide Volume Two', 'J. Douglas Arnold, Mark MacDonald, Mike Palmer, Mark Elies, Dave Zdyrko, Robert E. Waring, Lee Saito, Zach Iniguez', 'Sandwich Islands Publishing Company', 'OL390878M', '1998', 'Anglais', 'Mark Douglas', 'other', 'paperback', 'all', 125, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, 'This is a strategy and walkthrough guide for 10 Nintendo 64 (N64) games. It has many color screenshots for each game. It has tips, cheats strategies and fighter moves for the games. Each section tells the games \'Developer\', Publisher\', \'Age rating\', \'Number of Players\', Game Type\', the way the \'Gave Save\' is loaded, what \'Peripherals\' can be used to play it, its \'Pros\' and \'Cons\'. There is a second part to the book that has mini cheat codes and tips for 40 games, and a third part lists GameShark codes for 43 games. Parts of the \'Yoshi\'s Story\' section were previously published in \'Yoshi\'s Story: Survival Guide\' ISBN, 1884364438, condensed from 128 page book to 14 page section in this book, with fewer screenshots, most of which are reused from the previous book.', 'This is a strategy and walkthrough guide for 10 Nintendo 64 (N64) games. It has many color screenshots for each game. It has tips, cheats strategies and fighter moves for the games. Each section tells the games \'Developer\', Publisher\', \'Age rating\', \'Number of Players\', Game Type\', the way the \'Gave Save\' is loaded, what \'Peripherals\' can be used to play it, its \'Pros\' and \'Cons\'. There is a second part to the book that has mini cheat codes and tips for 40 games, and a third part lists GameShark', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Video games, Videogames, Games, Strategy, Puzzles, Passtimes, Hobbies, Nintendo 64, N64, Nintendo video games, Bomberman 64, Diddy Kong Racing, GoldenEye 007, Mischief Makers, NFL Quarterback Club \'98, Quake 64, San Francisco Rush: Extreme Racing, 1080° Snowboarding, WCW Vs. nWo World Tour, Yos