(3171, '942f85cc-5d9a-4ad2-a595-a7a997757cc1', '9781847825247', 'Don\'t touch me', NULL, 'Lauran Paine', 'Linford', 'OL29113715M', '2009', 'Anglais', 'Mark Douglas', 'novel', 'paperback', 'all', 227, 'black_white', NULL, NULL, '\"A jewel heist goes wrong when the escaping robbers abduct Gloria Vane, the beautiful film actress. Then as gang leader Ace Monohan falls for Gloria, it leads to dissension amongst his men, and the destruction and abandonment of his hideout. Ace, forced to go on the run, takes the stolen jewels with him. Now Gloria finds herself at the mercy of rival gangster \'Fingers\' Baxter, who plans to use her to lure Ace out of hiding...\"--Publisher description.', '\"A jewel heist goes wrong when the escaping robbers abduct Gloria Vane, the beautiful film actress. Then as gang leader Ace Monohan falls for Gloria, it leads to dissension amongst his men, and the destruction and abandonment of his hideout. Ace, forced to go on the run, takes the stolen jewels with him. Now Gloria finds herself at the mercy of rival gangster \'Fingers\' Baxter, who plans to use her to lure Ace out of hiding...\"--Publisher description.', 0.00, 0, 0, 'Gangsters, Kidnapping, Fiction, Fiction, thrillers, suspense, Missing persons, fiction, Crime, fiction', 1, '2026-07-21 15:55:03', '2026-07-21 15:55:03'),
